l,"logo":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/58977af744a1a594b62d1612948d3d0c2a68f81d-567x213.svg","name":"Evite"}],"team":[{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/92dfd51e1f15a98227f6308a075c490ce52c05b4-1000x1000.png","name":"Arnel Bukva","role":"Founder \u0026 Head of Growth"},{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/6319483485f60a53a65fc16888ea479b53f8743c-512x512.png","name":"Tamara Pavlovic","role":"Project Manager"},{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/9f087894f494f5e4082b429553c9ce52d55f7189-845x1024.png","name":"David Dobrijevic","role":"Webflow Expert"},{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/9bab7f300e2b3bd8af884c9ff8b40f0154f4a804-512x512.png","name":"Andrej Vidovic","role":"SEO/AEO Content Expert"},{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/dae3a1cb73008da8a30dea184a9b9318cbd4496f-512x512.jpg","name":"Rezwan Nahid","role":"Designer"},{"img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/488b75c60e51af983569f45f06d91017c41543b7-512x512.jpg","name":"Andrea Van Wyk","role":"Lead Copywriter"}],"tms":[{"body":"\u003cp\u003eWe are extremely happy with the landing page developed for us by LoudFace using Webflow. The team's expertise and attention to detail were evident from the start, and we began receiving leads immediately after the launch of our campaign. Their speed of work is great, and they maintained excellent communication throughout the project via Slack, ensuring that all our requirements were met promptly. We highly recommend LoudFace for their professionalism, skill, and commitment to customer satisfaction.\u003c/p\u003e","img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/5d48184d1daaa82e748eb911acf756c906f4c308-500x500.heif","name":"Daan Smit","role":"CEO \u0026 Founder | Brandfirm"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eI had the pleasure of working with the Loudface team to design our company website. They were professional, very helpful, communicated well, and met deadlines on time. I cannot stress how easy it was to work with them, and I would highly recommend them as your go-to service. Our website now looks amazing, and we have received great feedback from our clients. Thank you Loudface!!\u003c/p\u003e","img":null,"name":"Christian","role":"CEO | Eco Living"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eIt was very refreshing working with you compared to other agencies we're working with\u003c/p\u003e","img":null,"name":"Anthony Dean","role":"Radisson Hotels Group"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eHad the pleasure of working with LoudFace on our clients landing pages as well as our own company website. Highly professional guys with quality as its cornerstone. Good communication too. We really felt that they cared for our project as if it were their own.Would recommend Loudface to anyone!\u003c/p\u003e","img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/0ed43804f6ff3a18f682aec8a90f8ef6134015b7-3040x3148.jpg","name":"Christian Mailind","role":"Co-Founder | CourseEngine"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eI received excellent help and service from LoudFace with super fast responses and completely according to my wishes. I got to be involved and shape every part of the website, and it was always done quickly and professionally, as well as with a personal and pleasant approach. I highly recommend LoudFace!\u003c/p\u003e","img":null,"name":"Cajsa Olsson","role":"CEO \u0026 Founder | Countive"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eLoudFace really stood out with their approach and let's get this done attitude. And we felt as a partner rather than a client\u003c/p\u003e","img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/990d42447548aaaec62dd01280927a94aba8ffdf-512x512.png","name":"Elizabete","role":"Product Marketer | Reiterate"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eYour process and work were smooth. Working with you helped us realize the improvements needed for our brand and messaging. We really appreciate your contributions\u003c/p\u003e","img":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xjjjqhgt/production/2e1240dc5770115c2109607137db4604ca465c93-512x512.png","name":"Domenic Ashburn","role":"Founder | Grateful Labs"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eFIRE! This is better than I thought. NICE JOB. Been a pleasure working with you. I love the pace of execution. Also, a lot of appreciation for the transparent Figma file. I hate when agencies work behind the curtains.\u003c/p\u003e","img":null,"name":"Kasimir Hellman","role":"CEO \u0026 Founder | Onne"}]},"syncTags":["s1:sWQD7A","s1:jebz/w","s1:jMrD4g","s1:wG9nAQ","s1:XJ7ltg","s1:95Cibg","s1:sa6icg","s1:gEyr3Q","s1:MJvqlg","s1:sFVU6A","s1:uSyHCg","s1:ZB3BHA","s1:IVOoWA","s1:DFF4lw","s1:MgUt2Q","s1:vu2mqw","s1:uMp31A","s1:ODykWw","s1:0YWFGg","s1:CpBAXQ","s1:GFYppw","s1:d47khg","s1:P+HTDg","s1:Koi42w","s1:EVn/Ig","s1:X2Tlkw","s1:ZHVAzg","s1:i2qRIQ","s1:k4GGYA","s1:TV5ggw","s1:OipEvQ","s1:E3EAJw","s1:KIIb8w","s1:goCMFg","s1:YN9DSA","s1:+PeN+A","s1:MSDleg","s1:UdgZAQ","s1:kiMw7g","s1:cV5nWA","s1:5oH3wQ","s1:Ltsg0g","s1:VU3xxw","s1:cNeaSg","s1:IrbL6g","s1:UTUWpQ","s1:mS0Mrg","s1:7EaZDQ","s1:YbMQHg","s1:ToDkVA","s1:uTLzzA","s1:GnikSA"],"ms":51}